---

---

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden pt-14 pb-12 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-16">
  <!-- Soft radial glow, top-right -->
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(60%_50%_at_85%_25%,rgba(100,170,210,0.10),transparent_70%)]"
  >
  </div>

  <!-- Hint of arena from below -->
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 -z-10 h-1/2 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom,_rgba(250,222,170,0.05),_transparent_75%)]"
  >
  </div>

  <!-- Floating bubbles, decorative, hidden on mobile -->
  <svg
    class="anim-float-soft pointer-events-none absolute top-24 right-[8%] -z-10 hidden h-10 w-10 text-celeste/25 md:block"
    viewBox="0 0 40 40"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.4"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="14"></circle>
    <circle cx="14" cy="15" r="2.5"></circle>
  </svg>
  <svg
    class="anim-drift pointer-events-none absolute top-40 right-[18%] -z-10 hidden h-6 w-6 text-arena/35 md:block"
    viewBox="0 0 40 40"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.4"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="14"></circle>
  </svg>

  <!-- Drifting fish on the left edge -->
  <svg
    class="anim-drift pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 -left-2 -z-10 hidden h-16 w-28 -translate-y-1/2 text-arena/15 lg:block"
    viewBox="0 0 120 60"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.4"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <path d="M10 30 Q 40 8 70 30 Q 40 52 10 30 Z"></path>
    <path d="M70 30 L 110 14 L 110 46 Z"></path>
    <circle cx="28" cy="26" r="1.8" fill="currentColor"></circle>
  </svg>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <!-- Eyebrow -->
    <div class="reveal flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4">
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-10 bg-arena sm:w-16"></span>
      <span
        class="font-display text-xs tracking-[0.4em] text-arena uppercase sm:text-sm"
      >
        Lee un fragmento
      </span>
    </div>

    <!-- Headline -->
    <h1
      class="reveal reveal-delay-1 mt-6 max-w-4xl font-display text-[clamp(2.5rem,7.5vw,5rem)] leading-[0.95] tracking-tight text-caparol"
    >
      Asómate
      <span class="block">
        a la
        <span class="relative inline-block hand-underline text-arena">
          aventura
          <svg
            class="anim-float-soft pointer-events-none absolute -top-6 -right-6 h-6 w-6 text-celeste sm:-top-8 sm:-right-8 sm:h-8 sm:w-8"
            viewBox="0 0 40 40"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="14"></circle>
            <circle cx="14" cy="15" r="2.5"></circle>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Lead -->
    <p
      class="reveal reveal-delay-2 mt-8 max-w-3xl font-display text-xl leading-tight text-celeste sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl"
    >
      Un pequeño esbozo del mundo marino donde se desarrolla
      <em class="not-italic text-arena">Si los peces hablaran…</em>, Sumérgete
      en la aventura antes de decidirte a comprar el libro.
    </p>

    <!-- Quick anchors -->
    <div
      class="reveal reveal-delay-3 mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm"
    >
      <a
        href="#fragmento"
        class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-display tracking-wide text-celeste uppercase transition hover:text-caparol"
      >
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          class="h-5 w-5"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.8"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M4 4h7a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v12"></path>
          <path d="M20 4h-7a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v12"></path>
        </svg>
        Abrir el fragmento
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-y-0.5"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <span
        aria-hidden="true"
        class="hidden h-4 w-px bg-caparol/25 sm:inline-block"></span>
      <a
        href="/comprar"
        class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-display tracking-wide text-arena uppercase transition hover:text-caparol"
      >
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          class="h-5 w-5"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.8"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M3 7h18l-2 13H5z"></path>
          <path d="M8 7V5a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2"></path>
        </svg>
        Dónde comprarlo
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
